#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "The Executor primitive is part of the [directed execution model](/guides/directed-execution-model), which provides more flexibility when customizing an error mitigation workflow.\n"
msgstr "Ang Executor primitive ay bahagi ng [directed execution model](/guides/directed-execution-model), na nagbibigay ng mas maraming kakayahang umangkop kapag nag-cu-customize ng isang workflow ng error mitigation.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "The inputs and outputs of the Executor primitive are very different from those of the [Sampler](/guides/sampler-input-output) and [Estimator](/guides/estimator-input-output) primitives. For example, instead of taking a list of PUBs as the input, Executor takes a `QuantumProgram`, which contains a list of `QuantumProgramItem` objects. These container classes give you more flexibility than a PUB, which is a simple tuple data structure.\n"
msgstr "Ang mga input at output ng Executor primitive ay napaka-iba mula sa mga [Sampler](/guides/sampler-input-output) at [Estimator](/guides/estimator-input-output) primitive. Halimbawa, sa halip na tumanggap ng listahan ng mga PUB bilang input, ang Executor ay tumatanggap ng isang `QuantumProgram`, na naglalaman ng listahan ng mga object na `QuantumProgramItem`. Ang mga container class na ito ay nagbibigay sa iyo ng mas maraming kakayahang umangkop kaysa sa isang PUB, na isang simpleng tuple data structure.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "Executor's output is a `QuantumProgramResult`, which is an iterable and contains one element for each input `QuantumProgramItem`.\n"
msgstr "Ang output ng Executor ay isang `QuantumProgramResult`, na isang iterable at naglalaman ng isang elemento para sa bawat input na `QuantumProgramItem`.\n"

